		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b505b0d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="b505b0d" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[],&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1d85aa8 elementor-widget__width-inherit elementor-widget-mobile__width-initial elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="1d85aa8" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;}" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h1 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">אבל אז החלטתי לעשות סטופ</h1>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8bfd97b elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="8bfd97b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:100}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>בגיל 40, אחרי שהגעתי לעצמאות כלכלית וסגרתי את קרן הגידור שלי, חשבתי שהגעתי לפסגה.</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-10c05c4 e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child" data-id="10c05c4" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-982521b elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box" data-id="982521b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image-box.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<div class="elementor-image-box-wrapper"><figure class="elementor-image-box-img"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="88" height="61" src="https://cyclestrading.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Group-50.png" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-11187" alt="" /></figure><div class="elementor-image-box-content"><div class="elementor-image-box-title">התגלית</div><p class="elementor-image-box-description">נחשפתי לשיטת מסחר מחזורית מהמאה ה-19</p></div></div>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-04f8fbc elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box" data-id="04f8fbc" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image-box.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<div class="elementor-image-box-wrapper"><figure class="elementor-image-box-img"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="88" height="61" src="https://cyclestrading.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Group-50-2.png" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-11192" alt="" /></figure><div class="elementor-image-box-content"><div class="elementor-image-box-title">התוצאה</div><p class="elementor-image-box-description">הבנתי שכל מה שהשגתי עד אז היה רק הנדבך הראשון</p></div></div>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6f5c351 elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box" data-id="6f5c351" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image-box.default">
