		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-23dacaa e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="23dacaa" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" id="midform" data-settings="{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[],&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f975720 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="f975720" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1a55f40 elementor-widget-mobile__width-initial elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="1a55f40" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:100}" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">וזה עבד בטירוף - הדברים הפכו להיות ברורים הרבה יותר.</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a6a54cb elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="a6a54cb" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:100}" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="359" height="13" src="https://cyclestrading.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Vector-2025-03-06T152231.493.svg" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-1509" alt="" />															</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-cc4abd4 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="cc4abd4" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:100}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>מה זה ברורים? כאילו סיפקו לי מפת דרכים לאוצר של שוק ההון.  השילוב בין שיטות המסחר שפיתחתי לאורך השנים יחד עם השיטה המחזורית פשוט היה קטלני. אבל אחרי שנתיים של ישיבה בבית &quot;בפנסיה&quot;, השעמום אכל אותי, כך שהתחיל לבעור בי הרצון לעזור גם לאחרים להצליח.</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-052d2c8 e-con-full animated-fast e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-child" data-id="052d2c8" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[],&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;,&quot;animation_delay&quot;:200}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-12811e9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="12811e9" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">השאירו פרטים ונחזור אליך לשיחה אישית על תוכנית ההכשרה שלנו</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e499820 elementor-widget__width-inherit elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-mobile-button-align-center elementor-button-align-stretch elementor-widget elementor-widget-form" data-id="e499820" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" id="footer-button2" data-settings="{&quot;button_width&quot;:&quot;25&quot;,&quot;step_next_label&quot;:&quot;Next&quot;,&quot;step_previous_label&quot;:&quot;Previous&quot;,&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;step_type&quot;:&quot;number_text&quot;,&quot;step_icon_shape&quot;:&quot;circle&quot;}" data-widget_type="form.default">
