					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">גישת המסחר המחזורי</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b9c75b3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="b9c75b3" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:100}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>ללמוד איך לזהות מחזורי זמן ותאריכים<br />שבהם השוק צפוי להפוך כיוון. השיטה שתגרום לך להבין<br />איך מפולות והזדמנויות נבנות הרבה לפני שהן קורות<br />ולהפוך את השוק לכלי שעובד בשבילך.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8536296 e-con-full animated-fast e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-child" data-id="8536296" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[],&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;,&quot;animation_delay&quot;:200}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0666721 animated-fast elementor-view-default elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon" data-id="0666721" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;}" data-widget_type="icon.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="elementor-icon-wrapper">
			<div class="elementor-icon">
			<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="77" height="57" viewBox="0 0 77 57" fill="none"><path d="M53.9788 47.2844L19.5421 43.6669C10.0433 42.6631 3.14009 34.1462 4.13783 24.6368C5.13557 15.1274 13.6608 8.22641 23.1702 9.22415L57.6069 12.8417C67.1163 13.8394 74.0089 22.3624 73.0111 31.8718C72.0134 41.3812 63.4882 48.2822 53.9788 47.2844Z" fill="#C9ED8A"></path><path d="M29.7702 25.336C29.7702 22.84 28.2982 21.272 25.7702 21.272C23.2102 21.272 21.8022 22.808 21.8022 25.336V30.584C21.8022 33.112 23.2102 34.648 25.7702 34.648C28.2982 34.648 29.7702 33.08 29.7702 30.584V25.336ZM16.9702 31.032V24.888C16.9702 19.832 20.1702 16.92 24.4902 16.92H27.0502C31.3702 16.92 34.6022 19.96 34.6022 24.888V31.032C34.6022 35.96 31.3702 39 27.0502 39H24.4902C20.1702 39 16.9702 36.088 16.9702 31.032ZM37.5364 23.448C37.2484 23.448 37.0564 23.288 37.0564 22.968C37.2804 19.128 39.8084 16.92 43.4884 16.92H46.7524C50.5924 16.92 53.5364 18.968 53.5364 22.936C53.5364 25.112 52.6724 26.744 50.9124 27.672C52.8004 28.504 53.8564 30.392 53.8564 32.856C53.8564 36.824 50.9124 39 47.0724 39H43.3284C39.6484 39 37.1204 36.792 36.8964 32.952C36.8964 32.632 37.0884 32.472 37.3764 32.472H41.2804C41.5684 32.472 41.7284 32.632 41.7924 32.888C41.9844 34.232 43.1044 34.68 44.6724 34.68H45.6964C47.4564 34.68 48.6724 33.976 48.6724 32.344C48.6724 30.872 47.5204 29.976 46.0164 29.976H41.5684C41.2804 29.976 41.0884 29.784 41.0884 29.496V26.168C41.0884 25.88 41.2804 25.688 41.5684 25.688H45.8564C47.2964 25.688 48.3524 24.792 48.3524 23.448C48.3524 21.816 47.1364 21.24 45.4084 21.24H44.8324C43.2644 21.24 42.1444 21.688 41.9524 23.032C41.8884 23.288 41.7284 23.448 41.4404 23.448H37.5364Z" fill="#173C56"></path></svg>			</div>
		</div>
						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-bf60167 elementor-widget-mobile__width-initial elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="bf60167" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">הכרת השוק מבפנים</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a6e70c3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="a6e70c3" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:100}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>מהו שוק ההון באמת?<br />איך בורסה עובדת?  מי הם השחקנים שמניעים את הכלכלה?<br />בוא להבין את המשחק מהשורש  להכיר את<br />השפה, הכללים והאסטרטגיות שפועלות בשטח.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9c43969 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="9c43969" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-57685af e-con-full animated-fast e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-child" data-id="57685af" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[],&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;,&quot;animation_delay&quot;:300}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5214c73 animated-fast elementor-view-default elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon" data-id="5214c73" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;}" data-widget_type="icon.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="elementor-icon-wrapper">
			<div class="elementor-icon">
			<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="78" height="57" viewBox="0 0 78 57" fill="none"><path d="M54.053 47.2844L19.6163 43.6669C10.1175 42.6631 3.21431 34.1462 4.21205 24.6368C5.20978 15.1274 13.735 8.22641 23.2444 9.22415L57.6811 12.8417C67.1905 13.8394 74.0831 22.3624 73.0854 31.8718C72.0876 41.3812 63.5624 48.2822 54.053 47.2844Z" fill="#C9ED8A"></path><path d="M27.9694 25.336C27.9694 22.84 26.4974 21.272 23.9694 21.272C21.4094 21.272 20.0014 22.808 20.0014 25.336V30.584C20.0014 33.112 21.4094 34.648 23.9694 34.648C26.4974 34.648 27.9694 33.08 27.9694 30.584V25.336ZM15.1694 31.032V24.888C15.1694 19.832 18.3694 16.92 22.6894 16.92H25.2494C29.5694 16.92 32.8014 19.96 32.8014 24.888V31.032C32.8014 35.96 29.5694 39 25.2494 39H22.6894C18.3694 39 15.1694 36.088 15.1694 31.032ZM50.4877 24.44C50.7757 24.44 50.9677 24.632 50.9677 24.92V30.264H53.3357C53.6237 30.264 53.8157 30.456 53.8157 30.744V34.104C53.8157 34.392 53.6237 34.584 53.3357 34.584H50.9677V38.52C50.9677 38.808 50.7757 39 50.4877 39H46.6157C46.3277 39 46.1357 38.808 46.1357 38.52V34.584H35.8957C35.6077 34.584 35.4157 34.392 35.4157 34.104V32.056C35.4157 31.832 35.4477 31.672 35.5437 31.448L41.6557 17.272C41.7517 17.048 41.9437 16.92 42.1997 16.92H46.4557C46.8077 16.92 46.9677 17.144 46.8077 17.496L41.3677 30.264H46.1357V24.92C46.1357 24.632 46.3277 24.44 46.6157 24.44H50.4877Z" fill="#173C56"></path></svg>			</div>
		</div>
						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9e4b673 elementor-widget-mobile__width-initial elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="9e4b673" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">ניתוח פונדמנטלי וטכני</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-77473f7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="77473f7" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:100}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>למד איך להעריך מניות ונכסים פיננסיים<br />גם מנקודת מבט כלכלית וגם גרפית.<br />ניתוח דו-כיווני שעוזר לך לראות את כל<br />התמונה ולא רק חלק ממנה.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-944e3cf e-con-full animated-fast e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-child" data-id="944e3cf" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[],&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;,&quot;animation_delay&quot;:400}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-346197a animated-fast elementor-view-default elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon" data-id="346197a" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;}" data-widget_type="icon.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="elementor-icon-wrapper">
			<div class="elementor-icon">
			<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="78" height="57" viewBox="0 0 78 57" fill="none"><path d="M54.053 47.2844L19.6163 43.6669C10.1175 42.6631 3.21431 34.1462 4.21205 24.6368C5.20978 15.1274 13.735 8.22641 23.2444 9.22415L57.6811 12.8417C67.1905 13.8394 74.0831 22.3624 73.0854 31.8718C72.0876 41.3812 63.5624 48.2822 54.053 47.2844Z" fill="#C9ED8A"></path><path d="M31.1882 25.336C31.1882 22.84 29.7162 21.272 27.1882 21.272C24.6282 21.272 23.2202 22.808 23.2202 25.336V30.584C23.2202 33.112 24.6282 34.648 27.1882 34.648C29.7162 34.648 31.1882 33.08 31.1882 30.584V25.336ZM18.3882 31.032V24.888C18.3882 19.832 21.5882 16.92 25.9082 16.92H28.4682C32.7882 16.92 36.0202 19.96 36.0202 24.888V31.032C36.0202 35.96 32.7882 39 28.4682 39H25.9082C21.5882 39 18.3882 36.088 18.3882 31.032ZM52.1384 20.76C52.1384 21.048 51.9464 21.24 51.6584 21.24H43.7864C43.6584 21.24 43.5624 21.336 43.5624 21.464V25.176H47.4664C51.4664 25.176 53.9624 28.056 53.9624 32.056C53.9624 36.184 51.4664 39 47.1784 39H39.1144C38.8264 39 38.6344 38.808 38.6344 38.52V35.16C38.6344 34.872 38.8264 34.68 39.1144 34.68H46.1224C47.8504 34.68 49.0984 33.816 49.0984 32.056C49.0984 30.264 47.8504 29.4 46.1224 29.4H39.1144C38.8264 29.4 38.6344 29.208 38.6344 28.92V17.4C38.6344 17.112 38.8264 16.92 39.1144 16.92H51.6584C51.9464 16.92 52.1384 17.112 52.1384 17.4V20.76Z" fill="#173C56"></path></svg>			</div>
		</div>
						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7af66fb elementor-widget-mobile__width-initial elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="7af66fb" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">פתיחת חשבון והכנה מעשית</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-68a9b04 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="68a9b04" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:100}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>איך לפתוח חשבון מסחר בברוקר ישראלי או אמריקאי<br />בעמלות נמוכות. כל מה שאתה צריך לדעת כדי להתחיל<br />לסחור בפועל ולהרגיש בטוח כשאתה מתחיל את הדרך<br />שלך בעולם ההשקעות.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0de7683 e-con-full animated-fast e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-child" data-id="0de7683" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[],&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;,&quot;animation_delay&quot;:500}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9582e3e animated-fast elementor-view-default elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon" data-id="9582e3e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;}" data-widget_type="icon.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="elementor-icon-wrapper">
			<div class="elementor-icon">
			<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="77" height="57" viewBox="0 0 77 57" fill="none"><path d="M53.9788 47.2844L19.5421 43.6669C10.0433 42.6631 3.14009 34.1462 4.13783 24.6368C5.13557 15.1274 13.6608 8.22641 23.1702 9.22415L57.6069 12.8417C67.1163 13.8394 74.0089 22.3624 73.0111 31.8718C72.0134 41.3812 63.4882 48.2822 53.9788 47.2844Z" fill="#C9ED8A"></path><path d="M30.2389 25.336C30.2389 22.84 28.7669 21.272 26.2389 21.272C23.6789 21.272 22.2709 22.808 22.2709 25.336V30.584C22.2709 33.112 23.6789 34.648 26.2389 34.648C28.7669 34.648 30.2389 33.08 30.2389 30.584V25.336ZM17.4389 31.032V24.888C17.4389 19.832 20.6389 16.92 24.9589 16.92H27.5189C31.8389 16.92 35.0709 19.96 35.0709 24.888V31.032C35.0709 35.96 31.8389 39 27.5189 39H24.9589C20.6389 39 17.4389 36.088 17.4389 31.032ZM46.4212 25.176C50.8692 25.176 54.0372 27.672 54.0372 31.832C54.0372 35.896 51.0612 39 46.7732 39H44.4052C40.1172 39 37.2372 35.864 37.2372 31.832V24.888C37.2372 19.832 40.4372 16.92 44.7572 16.92H50.3252C50.6132 16.92 50.8052 17.112 50.8052 17.4V20.792C50.8052 21.08 50.6132 21.272 50.3252 21.272H45.6852C43.1252 21.272 41.7172 22.808 41.7172 25.336V26.84C42.7732 25.848 44.4692 25.176 46.4212 25.176ZM42.0052 32.088C42.0052 33.816 43.4132 34.776 45.5892 34.776C47.7652 34.776 49.1732 33.784 49.1732 32.088C49.1732 30.328 47.7652 29.4 45.5892 29.4C43.4132 29.4 42.0052 30.328 42.0052 32.088Z" fill="#173C56"></path></svg>			</div>
		</div>
						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8d7c5e2 elementor-widget-mobile__width-initial elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="8d7c5e2" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">תפעול מערכת המסחר</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-aef44f6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="aef44f6" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:100}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>תפעול מערכת הגרפים ומערכת המסחר של<br />הברוקר בצורה מדויקת. איך לבנות רשימות מעקב<br />ממוקדות לזיהוי הזדמנויות ולבצע עסקאות בצורה<br />חכמה מקצועית.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4c5d9ff e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="4c5d9ff" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-724e365 e-con-full animated-fast e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-child" data-id="724e365" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[],&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;,&quot;animation_delay&quot;:600}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1191d05 animated-fast elementor-view-default elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon" data-id="1191d05" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;}" data-widget_type="icon.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="elementor-icon-wrapper">
			<div class="elementor-icon">
			<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="78" height="57" viewBox="0 0 78 57" fill="none"><path d="M54.053 47.2844L19.6163 43.6669C10.1175 42.6631 3.21431 34.1462 4.21205 24.6368C5.20978 15.1274 13.735 8.22641 23.2444 9.22415L57.6811 12.8417C67.1905 13.8394 74.0831 22.3624 73.0854 31.8718C72.0876 41.3812 63.5624 48.2822 54.053 47.2844Z" fill="#C9ED8A"></path><path d="M30.5319 25.336C30.5319 22.84 29.0599 21.272 26.5319 21.272C23.9719 21.272 22.5639 22.808 22.5639 25.336V30.584C22.5639 33.112 23.9719 34.648 26.5319 34.648C29.0599 34.648 30.5319 33.08 30.5319 30.584V25.336ZM17.7319 31.032V24.888C17.7319 19.832 20.9319 16.92 25.2519 16.92H27.8119C32.1319 16.92 35.3639 19.96 35.3639 24.888V31.032C35.3639 35.96 32.1319 39 27.8119 39H25.2519C20.9319 39 17.7319 36.088 17.7319 31.032ZM53.3382 16.92C53.6262 16.92 53.8182 17.112 53.8182 17.4V19.512C53.8182 19.736 53.7862 19.896 53.6902 20.12L45.2742 38.648C45.1782 38.872 44.9862 39 44.7302 39H40.3142C39.9622 39 39.8022 38.776 39.9622 38.424L48.0582 21.24H38.1062C37.8182 21.24 37.6262 21.048 37.6262 20.76V17.4C37.6262 17.112 37.8182 16.92 38.1062 16.92H53.3382Z" fill="#173C56"></path></svg>			</div>
		</div>
						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-35b752a elementor-widget-mobile__width-initial elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="35b752a" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">אסטרטגיות מסחר מתקדמות</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-166ae26 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="166ae26" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:100}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>איך לזהות הזדמנויות מסחר אמיתיות ולא לפספס את<br />העסקה הבאה שלך. שיטות שנבנו על פי ניסיון של<br />למעלה מ-24 שנה בעולם ההשקעות.<br />שיטות שעובדות כל פעם מחדש.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4d73ebe e-con-full animated-fast e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-child" data-id="4d73ebe" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[],&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;,&quot;animation_delay&quot;:700}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6fe2a26 animated-fast elementor-view-default elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon" data-id="6fe2a26" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;}" data-widget_type="icon.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="elementor-icon-wrapper">
			<div class="elementor-icon">
